  "mode": "normal",
  "limits": [
    "native VM scope: 1/2/4 active xAPIC CPUs, fixed process affinity, serialized kernel",
    "ACPI MADT, xAPIC, 64-bit HPET and startup page 0x8000 required",
    "x87/SSE state; no AVX, migration, file paging, Windows apps or installer",
    "8 thread slots, 2 address spaces, 16 anonymous VM pages per space",
    "early allocator manages conventional memory below 1 GiB",
    "M4.5 remains in progress: ordinary AHCI/NVMe reads, GPT/MBR validation and read-only FAT32",
    "Existing marked 16 MiB M4 ext2 write path retained; ordinary disks are not formatted or mounted writable",
    "Secure Boot tests use owner-enrolled disposable TCG NVRAM and a separate signed/hash-pinned test loader, not factory trust",
    "BIOS EDD/E820/VBE and unsigned UEFI share the kernel; USB mass storage, broader input/filesystems and physical qualification remain open"
